  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Day of Zero Tolerance Against FGM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the Forum Against Harmful Practices (FAHP) International Day of Zero Tolerance against FGM (DZT) plans to raise awareness of the harmful impacts of FGM and advocate for action to protect the rights and health of women and girls. DZT is a call to action for Sierra Leone and the world to intensify efforts, strengthen laws, and foster collaboration to ensure a safer, more equitable future for women and girls.</narrative>
  </description>
